      "description": "Four equal project sections with an active underline.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-project-nav\" aria-label=\"Project sections\"><button class=\"ds-tab\" aria-current=\"page\">Overview</button><button class=\"ds-tab\">Parts</button><button class=\"ds-tab\">Files</button><button class=\"ds-tab\">Build</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-project-nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));width:min(440px,100%);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border,#dce1e8)}.ds-tab{font-family:var(--font-ui,\"IBM Plex Sans Variable\",system-ui,sans-serif);min-width:0;min-height:48px;padding:10px 16px;border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;border-radius:0;background:transparent;color:var(--muted-foreground,#536276);font-size:.9375rem;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer}.ds-tab[aria-current=page]{color:var(--primary,#1558e8);border-bottom-color:var(--primary,#1558e8);font-weight:600}.ds-tab:hover{color:var(--foreground,#152033)}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring,#1558e8);outline-offset:3px;}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-tab{padding-inline:6px;font-size:.875rem}}"
